    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ac0cd7d7e4a59.50217474\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In the latest WoW: Forever build, creatures can only be skinned once before they disappear. <br><br>The skinning profession allows players to skin certain types of creatures for leather. In WoW: Classic, once a mob was skinned once, the corpse would despawn. However, for the last two weeks of WoW: Forever, mobs were able to be skinned multiple times if players were grouped (once per group member), which increased the amount of leather that could be obtained from a single mob. For players, it was unclear if this was intended or a bug.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-source=\"false\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-header\"><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><ul class=\"first last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Skinning<ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Creatures can once again only be skinned a single time before disappearing.</div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div></div>In the latest WoW: Forever build, Blizzard has made it clear that this was a bug and the functionality has returned to one skinner per mob. This will change the leather economy when WoW: Forever launches on live servers on November 4th.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>In the latest WoW: Forever build, creatures can only be skinned once before they disappear. <br /><br />The skinning profession allows players to skin certain types of creatures for leather. In WoW: Classic, once a mob was skinned once, the corpse would despawn. However, for the last two weeks of WoW: Forever, mobs were able to be skinned multiple times if players were grouped (once per group member), which increased the amount of leather that could be obtained from a single mob. For players, it was unclear if this was intended or a bug. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\"><ul><li>Skinning<br />Creatures can once again only be skinned a single time before disappearing.</li></ul></div></div><br /><br />In the latest WoW: Forever build, Blizzard has made it clear that this was a bug and the functionality has returned to one skinner per mob. This will change the leather economy when WoW: Forever launches on live servers on November 4th.</noscript>            \n        ",
